# Docker builds that use the repo root as their context — today only the
# research agent (`pnpm deploy:fly` runs `flyctl deploy` from the repo root with
# `--dockerfile apps/research-agent/Dockerfile`). Docker ignores
# apps/research-agent/.dockerignore in that case, so without this file every
# local `.env*` (real keys) and all `node_modules` went to the remote builder.

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Installed and built output (the Dockerfile installs and builds inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.open-next
**/.turbo
**/.wrangler

# Repo metadata and the research agent's local sandbox workspace
.git
apps/research-agent/workspace
